              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kojenu bobo Adam akeberu; kouru ikoku yenitelepat, komaik ekekiror Set; kotema atiar, “Naarai abu Edeke kainak eoŋ auruun ice aibois naka Abel; naarai abu Kain koar ŋes.” ",
